***** if else *****

if [ condition ]
then
    # Run this if the condition is TRUE
else
    # Run this if the condition is FALSE
fi

if -> Check a condition
[ condition ] -> The condition to check
then -> Do this if the condition is true
else -> Do this if the condition is false
fi -> End the if statement

if starts the decision, and fi ends it.

-----------------------------------------

#!/bin/bash

NUMBER=15

if [ "$NUMBER" -gt 10 ]
then
    echo "Number is greater than 10"
else
    echo "Number is 10 or less"
fi

You may change the number values

